4", "text": "What about storing it on a singleton/autoload?", "timestamp": 1788969698, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "businessgoose001", "author_id": "1454565357", "id": "18144740314567043", "text": "Out of curiosity why attach it to the player and not as a global data cash ?", "timestamp": 1788813236, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "lurker_222", "author_id": "71601040145", "id": "17915057193429676", "text": "There is no secret, just use your brain", "timestamp": 1786111124, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "exerafid", "author_id": "69421174832", "id": "18030964652834931", "text": "Boolean stuff", "timestamp": 1785137386, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "zel_zelda_.faith", "author_id": "64600709243", "id": "18110982007960008", "text": "So basically xp???", "timestamp": 1784824226, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "your_friend_loganno", "author_id": "6006106234", "id": "17911472136440477", "text": "\"Ayo, you got my death certificate on you?\"", "timestamp": 1784352400, "like_count": 96}, {"author": "baylimonoyunlari", "author_id": "54270557032", "id": "17905257282280161", "text": "Amazing explanation!", "timestamp": 1783611122, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "stroyosh_", "author_id": "70584445226", "id": "18110693804304996", "text": "Always love these tricks, so much to learn!", "timestamp": 1783542353, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "materialdefender", "author_id": "239391582", "id": "18126916336648332", "text": "Beautiful editing in this video", "timestamp": 1783348759, "like_count": 6}, {"author": "kekeksz", "author_id": "11627229122", "id": "18055679351746241", "text": "What's with their HP? Do they just heal back every time you run a tiny bit further away?", "timestamp": 1782147584, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "dm_brickwall", "author_id": "72777639012", "id": "17975367624044564", "text": "I did the math and it\u2019s always more efficient to have a list of bits, one enemy in the game assigned to an index, than having all keys at max capacity", "timestamp": 1780767377, "like_count": 6}, {"author": "camarada_dragon", "author_id": "76754134036", "id": "17900874654288012", "text": "But do you use state machine for the enemies ?", "timestamp": 1779858222, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jamescoolio2", "author_id": "78048463950", "id": "17947912539188433", "text": "Oou shi\ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc40", "timestamp": 1779160017, "like_count": 15}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DX7-1qZtVhS/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DX7-1qZtVhS/", "webpage_url_basename": "DX7-1qZtVhS", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/684662543_17973804882013840_1258561431630097111_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=Mzg4OTk3OTA2OTcwODk4MjM1NDE3OTczODA0ODc2MDEzODQw.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=CElIMlRILwgQ7kNvwG5e1DO&_nc_oc=Ado66seMznngDy3txxvj-BCipEepXx_EOIPh6UQcf878sFSXH9SnbAwsrV7BnitFJ8o&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=tRtSKH5TYm2CdniZjmPEbg&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQT7ACiERHQJZy2nmzStyJ9I8SDWjQt7LfZPf-9RIj2kaA&oe=6AE87C04", "display_id": "DX7-1qZtVhS", "fulltitle": "Video by inboundshovel", "upload_date": "20260505", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793244006, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQPtjz3kmI13yZAb58cHrHRkCFWkpjISEzNt-tamZm7B6H0ikvBhaSOPmDkBhiiUl1FzzLAw3ON_mpKauHCuQbhmunUbrsYxI5hXbws.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=W5ZQvkvoR3UQ7kNvwE36ElK&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MjY1NTYyNjYyNTczODgwNTYsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjoxNzcsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo4NywidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&c